  "content_html": "<p>Breaking news from EWR, where I have basically spent most of the last 36 hours (forgive me if I am, as the kids might say, hella grouchy):</p><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://x.com/garymarcus/status/2121392535964885353?a=vidGhwTD6Hrtupi9w2I&amp;s=61&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;All <span class=\\&quot;tweet-fake-link\\&quot;>@united</span> flights have just been canceled at EWR. (and perhaps across the nation)&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;GaryMarcus&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Gary Marcus&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/2048405471900606464/kPeRHI2z_normal.jpg&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;2026-11-13T23:59:28.000Z&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{},&quot;reply_count&quot;:0,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:0,&quot;like_count&quot;:4,&quot;impression_count&quot;:492,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><p>Now for the backstory. We&#8217;ll start with this from three days ago.</p><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://x.com/petemuntean/status/2120228388904587702?a=zY7RoBoJLKUWOzlFXmc&amp;s=61&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;NEW: The FAA tells me it's rolling out its AI flight-routing tool nationwide. The goal? Fewer delays and shorter flight times. I got a look at how it works&#8212;including one flight the FAA says saved 42 minutes. But there are concerns about safety and oversight. &quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;petemuntean&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Pete Muntean&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/1498311265759997955/G1n0VdOy_normal.jpg&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;2026-11-10T18:53:34.000Z&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[{&quot;img_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!a_eC!,w_1028,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:best,fl_progressive:steep/l_play_button_usfui2,w_88,e_colorize:0/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F__ss-rehost__tw-video-preview-13_2120228304732950529.jpg&quot;,&quot;link_url&quot;:&quot;https://t.co/KX3PnURk1S&quot;}],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{},&quot;reply_count&quot;:102,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:445,&quot;like_count&quot;:1048,&quot;impression_count&quot;:241815,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_url&quot;:&quot;https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2120228304732950529/vid/avc1/1280x720/krIcTOuve6q0mGE_.mp4&quot;,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:&quot;13_2120228304732950529&quot;,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><p></p><p>And now let&#8217;s go further back. Flashback to 2022:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Q5Z3!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F85f212b4-7a6a-4231-aeeb-8d46331096ad_1233x1540.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Q5Z3!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F85f212b4-7a6a-4231-aeeb-8d46331096ad_1233x1540.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Q5Z3!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F85f212b4-7a6a-4231-aeeb-8d46331096ad_1233x1540.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Q5Z3!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F85f212b4-7a6a-4231-aeeb-8d46331096ad_1233x1540.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Q5Z3!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl