.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6e54937b-c00f-4c01-a41f-ff32713f6000_1285x1307.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"></button><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Tonight, as you probably already heard:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6w51!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5743d6bd-01a8-45b1-b670-d51cdb88435f_2319x1168.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6w51!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5743d6bd-01a8-45b1-b670-d51cdb88435f_2319x1168.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6w51!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5743d6bd-01a8-45b1-b670-d51cdb88435f_2319x1168.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6w51!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5743d6bd-01a8-45b1-b670-d51cdb88435f_2319x1168.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6w51!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5743d6bd-01a8-45b1-b670-d51cdb88435f_2319x1168.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6w51!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5743d6bd-01a8-45b1-b670-d51cdb88435f_2319x1168.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"733\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/5743d6bd-01a8-45b1-b670-d51cdb88435f_2319x1168.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:733,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:257130,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://garymarcus.substack.com/i/224824795?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5743d6bd-01a8-45b1-b670-d51cdb88435f_2319x1168.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6w51!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5743d6bd-01a8-45b1-b670-d51cdb88435f_2319x1168.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6w51!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5743d6bd-01a8-45b1-b670-d51cdb88435f_2319x1168.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6w51!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5743d6bd-01a8-45b1-b670-d51cdb88435f_2319x1168.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!6w51!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5743d6bd-01a8-45b1-b670-d51cdb88435f_2319x1168.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"></button><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Coincidence?</p><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://x.com/acyn/status/2121355054896853255?a=eoVU1N_EDFDH3ZiDplQ&amp;s=61&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;Schiavo: What's interesting to me about the ground stop is the FAA had also announced that it was about to deploy their new tool called SMART, to assist in managing air traffic across the entire national airspace system&#8230; \\n\\nI don't know if they're linked, but it's just too much &#8230;&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;Acyn&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Acyn&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/1332231334761119745/wMzlpuHi_normal.jpg&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;2026-11-13T21:30:32.000Z&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[{&quot;img_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!5lOZ!,w_1028,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:best,fl_progressive:steep/l_play_button_usfui2,w_88,e_colorize:0/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F__ss-rehost__tw-video-preview-13_2121355005919936512.jpg&quot;,&quot;link_url&quot;:&quot;https://t.co/4BTDGPcNes&quot;}],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{},&quot;reply_count&quot;:171,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:780,&quot;like_count&quot;:2707,&quot;impression_count&quot;:477329,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_url&quot;:&quot;https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2121355005919936512/vid/avc1/1280x720/xZ7I_YFqO-NFZV72.mp4?tag=16&quot;,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:&quot;13_2121355005919936512&quot;,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><p>Back in 2022, when I warned about sticking generative AI in LLMs, someone replied, intelligently enough, that nobody would ever be stupid enough to do the very thing I was warning about:</p><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://x.com/adhiguna_aiaas/status/1522787766106746881?a=bdp1z65RzkIR--b9NG8&amp;s=61&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;<span class=\\&quot;tweet-fake-link\\&quot;>@GaryMarcus</span> I developed aviation and avionics softwares. We are using heavy Formal Methods. These DL things are not allowed near those softwares under any circumstances. Hopefully noone in FAA and EASA are &#8220;innovative&#8221;&#8217;enough to let that happens.&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;Adhiguna_AIaaS&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;adhiguna mahendra&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/1458338659879436291/c9lhZpsI_normal.jpg&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;2022-05-07T03:57:50.000Z&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{},&quot;reply_count&quot;:1,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:0,&quot;like_count&quot;:4,&quot;impression_count&quot;:0,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><p>Those were the days, when sanity was still somewhere to be found.</p><p>&#167;</p><p>Oh, and yeah, we also had the huge Microsoft outage this week. I am sure AI has nothing to do with that one, either.</p><p>In fairness, we don&#8217;t know if this is the malicious kind of cyberattack I warned about in Politico January 2025, or the kinds LLM failures I warned about in May 2022. </p><p>But, honestly, at this point none of it should come as a surprise. </p><p>We are reaping what the arrogance of Silicon Valley &#8212; and the ineffectiveness of Washington &#8212; has sown.</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://garymarcus.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://garymarcus.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://x.com/garymarcus/status/2121379488248533458?a=U6M2qsWOcLbtAcjklu0&amp;s=61&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;i wonder if every alien civilization goes through an LLM phase where they wreck their civilization.\\n\\nand whether any make it out through to the other side.&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;GaryMarcus&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Gary Marcus&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/profile_images/2048405471900606464/kPeRHI2z_normal.jpg&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;2026-11-13T23:07:37.000Z&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{},&quot;reply_count&quot;:17,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:11,&quot;like_count&quot;:114,&quot;impression_count&quot;:4181,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><p>P.S. Media friends, if you want a fun live feed from the airport, give me a ring.</p>",
